CPU IDs are logical: distinct IDs may still share an SMT core. Coordinator parks during measurement.
Ring buffer: 2 producers, 2 consumers, busy spin, capacity 1024, ReleaseFast
Throughput is end-to-end broadcast delivery (unique events/s), including countdown bookkeeping.
Latency is a separate saturated, instrumented run: before produce() to the handler clock read, including backpressure and queueing. Clock/sample overhead remains; this is not fixed-arrival-rate latency.
